Package: gghockey
Title: Ice Hockey Rinks and Spatial Heatmaps for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Daniel", "Weinberger", , "5plusspieldauer@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Draws to-scale ice hockey rinks (IIHF and NHL dimensions, or
    your own) as 'ggplot2' layers, in horizontal or vertical orientation and
    cropped to any combination of zones. Adds a binned heatmap geom for
    on-ice event data whose squares are sized in rink units, so a map looks
    the same at any export size, plus matched colour, size and alpha scales,
    a rink theme, team colour palettes and optional centre-ice logos.
